  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Local Economic Recovery of Conflict-Affected Areas of Iraq</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to contribute to local economic recovery and community resilience through increased access to sustainable and decent work for vulnerable returnees, internally displaced persons, and host communities (including women) in Ninewa, Kirkuk and Baghdad in Iraq. The project specifically aims to improve access of communities to sustainable job opportunities and enhance the human capital of individuals which will improve their employability and economic inclusion.</narrative>
  </description>
